## Noncommercial Purposes

Any noncommercial purpose is permitted. A noncommercial purpose is any purpose that is not primarily intended for or directed toward commercial advantage or monetary compensation.

Examples of noncommercial purposes include:
- Personal use, research, learning, evaluation, and technical portfolio demonstration
- Educational, academic, and classroom use
- Non-monetized hobbyist projects, technical reviews, and testing

Examples of commercial purposes (strictly prohibited under this license without a commercial agreement) include:
- Selling, sublicensing, or distributing the software or derivative works
- Using the software to provide paid services, commercial products, or cloud SaaS offerings
- Integrating the software into proprietary internal commercial production systems

